  "description": "Fuaran.MVU.Browser: the standard client kinds for Fuaran.MVU in the browser. The client effects of Fuaran.ClientEffects (clipboard, navigation, history, focus, download, file read, print, confirm) with storage and the timers, each kind registered once with its classes so the gate decides it; a performer per kind, each a one-shot answer or none; the vocabulary embedded as one case of an application's effect type; and the browser host on the kernel's growing queue. Depends on Fuaran.MVU, FSharp.Core, Fuaran.ClientEffects and Fable.Core.",
